📊 5. Price-Based Ranking

When treatment results are found, CAREKART sorts them by price so users can easily identify lower-cost options.

Example:

Knee Replacement

1. Safdarjung Hospital — ₹75,000
2. AIIMS — ₹80,000
3. Sir Ganga Ram Hospital — ₹1,50,000
4. Max Super Speciality Hospital — ₹2,00,000
5. Apollo Hospital Delhi — ₹2,20,000
6. Fortis Hospital Vasant Kunj — ₹2,50,000
⭐ 6. Hospital Ratings

Each hospital in the prototype includes a sample rating, allowing users to consider both:

Price + Rating

instead of looking at price alone.

